problems.problem:
(a) The main hall of a conference centre consists of **15 rows** arranged amphitheatrically so that as many delegates as possible have an unobstructed view of the stage. The **first (1st)** row has **20** seats, while **each subsequent** row has **5 more seats** than the previous one. That is, **20** delegates can sit in the **1st** row, **25** in the **2nd** row, **30** in the **3rd** row, and so on.

